    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Withstand the Horrors of Frigid Wastelands</p></blockquote><p>Winter Walkers hone their craft in the bleak, frozen wilds of places like Icewind Dale. These ruthless, rime-covered Rangers hunt the monsters that haunt the arctic wastes, eventually becoming frigid terrors themselves. They know the phenomena of Icewind Dale well, including the latent magic of fallen Netherese cities, native monsters such as yetis and crag cats, and the rising threat of Underdark invaders.</p><p>Their cold pragmatism, terrifying magic, and mastery of the region earn them equal parts respect and fear. Ten-Towns folk say their frequent contact with malevolent entities gives them their fearsome powers, while many Reghed nomads believe that nature spirits lay a unique curse on them.</p><h3>Winter Walker Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.VtdX7Q644JBr0B4E]{Frigid Explorer}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.YZstGoOPkgaueB3W]{Hunter's Rime}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.N9AcaFdxYQA2jJCt]{Winter Walker Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.9t8rEOb75wi6b2RI]{Fortifying Soul}</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.qDRpuEfavU8JvO6x]{Chilling Retribution}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.MO5xePHoL5tSaJJU]{Frozen Haunt}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Winter Walker Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Ranger Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplIceKnife00]{Ice Knife}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHoldPerson]{Hold Person}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRemoveCurs]{Remove Curse}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplIceStorm00]{Ice Storm}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplConeofCold]{Cone of Cold}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
